// Blind ISO v2 (DRAFT). Hero SB/BB isolation, not limped BB check or standard RFI.
// No new air bluff. Strong hands/price and position matter; all sizes provisional.
##f$H6BISOStrong##
WHEN (HaveNuts) RETURN TRUE FORCE
WHEN (HaveQuads) RETURN TRUE FORCE
