WHEN (f$H6BISOHU AND AmountToCall > 0 AND HaveNutFlushDraw AND AmountToCall <= 27% PotSize) Call FORCE
WHEN (f$H6BISOValid AND AmountToCall > 0) Fold FORCE
WHEN (f$H6BISOValid AND AmountToCall = 0 AND HaveNuts) BetTwoThirdPot FORCE
WHEN (f$H6BISOHU AND f$H6BISOBB AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$H6BISOStrong) BetHalfPot FORCE
WHEN (f$H6BISOHU AND f$H6BISOSB AND AmountToCall = 0 AND f$H6BISOStrong) BetThirdPot FORCE
